  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Kimi Räikkönen is a Finnish racing driver who won the 2007 Formula One world championship with Ferrari. Known as the Iceman, he earned his fortune through racing contracts and endorsements. His career brought twenty-one Grand Prix victories, spells with five Formula One teams and two seasons in the World Rally Championship.",
    "confidence": {
      "score": 98,
